{"id":"ordinarium.kyrie","title":"Kýrie, eléison","category":"ordinarium","section":"missa-catechumenorum","variant":"missae","sung":true,"st":"working-edition","ad":5,"adw":2,"about":{"pl":"Greckie wezwanie o miłosierdzie. Trzykrotne „Kýrie eléison” prowadzi do trzykrotnego „Christe eléison”, po którym „Kýrie eléison” powraca jeszcze trzy razy.","en":"A Greek invocation for mercy. Three repetitions of “Kýrie eléison” lead to three of “Christe eléison”, after which “Kýrie eléison” returns three more times."},"seg":[{"id":"s01","type":"rubric","text":"Qua finita, iunctis manibus, et alternatim cum Ministris, dicit:","an":8,"nr":{"pl":"Ze złożonymi rękami kapłan odmawia wezwania na przemian z usługującymi. Jeśli nikt mu nie odpowiada, sam mówi wszystkie dziewięć.","en":"With hands joined, the priest says the invocations alternately with the ministers. If no one answers him, he says all nine himself."}},{"id":"s02","type":"verse","speaker":"sacerdos","voice":"clara","participation":{"cantu":{"gradus":2,"source":"DMS 25 b"}},"w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Kýrie","l":"kyrie","p":",","m":47,"a":3},{"i":"w002","f":"eléison","l":"eleison","p":".","m":48}],"tr":{"pl":"Panie, zmiłuj się.","en":"Lord, have mercy."},"g":{"pl":["Panie","zmiłuj się"],"en":["Lord","have mercy"]},"tc":{"en":[199]}},{"id":"s03","type":"verse","speaker":"minister","voice":"clara","participation":{"lecta":{"gradus":2,"source":"DMS 31 b"},"cantu":{"gradus":2,"source":"DMS 25 b"}},"w":[{"i":"w003","f":"Kýrie","l":"kyrie","p":",","m":47,"a":3},{"i":"w004","f":"eléison","l":"eleison","p":".","m":48}],"tr":{"pl":"Panie, zmiłuj się.","en":"Lord, have mercy."},"g":{"pl":["Panie","zmiłuj się"],"en":["Lord","have mercy"]},"tc":{"en":[199]}},{"id":"s04","type":"verse","speaker":"sacerdos","voice":"clara","participation":{"cantu":{"gradus":2,"source":"DMS 25 b"}},"w":[{"i":"w005","f":"Kýrie","l":"kyrie","p":",","m":47,"a":3},{"i":"w006","f":"eléison","l":"eleison","p":".","m":48}],"tr":{"pl":"Panie, zmiłuj się.","en":"Lo